# ── Model weights & exports ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .pt weights auto-download on first run (Ultralytics); the .engine is
# hardware-specific and must be re-exported per GPU (python export_engine.py).
*.pt
*.engine
*.onnx
# ...but DO ship the ANPR plate detector — it's a custom fine-tune, not
# something Ultralytics can auto-download (6 MB, MIT). See models/README.md.
!models/license_plate_detector.pt
# ...and the trained weapon detector (yolo26n fine-tune on YouTube-GDD, ~6 MB),
# so a fresh clone can demo gun detection without re-training. See models/README.md.
!models/weapon_detector.pt
# ...and the InsightFace RetinaFace detector (17 MB, non-commercial research licence).
# The ArcFace recogniser (w600k_r50.onnx, 167 MB) is excluded — over GitHub's 100 MB
# hard limit; it ships in the release package but is not committed to the repo.
!models/face/models/ibvap_face/det_10g.onnx

# ── Generated test media ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Rebuild with:  python make_test_videos.py
test_videos/
test_input.*
*_detected.*

# ── TLS (regenerate: python gen_cert.py) ────────────────────────────────────
cert.pem
key.pem

# ── Runtime data ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
data/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.jsonl

# ── Continuous learning / fine-tunes ───────────────────────────────────────
# Harvested datasets + training runs are large + machine-specific. The
# fine-tuned weights (continuous-learning yolo26n_ft_*.pt AND night
# yolo26n_thermal_*.pt) are git-ignored by `models/*.pt` below; only the small
# tracked JSONs (models/registry.json, models/weapon_registry.json) travel with
# the repo. Re-train with retrain.py / train_thermal.py per machine.
datasets/
!datasets/README.md
runs/
models/*.pt
!models/license_plate_detector.pt
# The weapon detector IS shipped (custom yolo26n fine-tune, ~5 MB) — re-negate
# it here because this later `models/*.pt` rule would otherwise win. See
# models/README.md / docs/WEAPON_DETECTION.md.
!models/weapon_detector.pt
# The plate OCR (fast-plate-ocr ONNX + config, ~few MB) also ships so the demo
# reads plates out of the box. Timestamped runs stay ignored.
!models/plate_ocr/
!models/plate_ocr/**
models/license_plate_detector_*.pt
models/yolo26n_thermal_*.pt

# ── cloudflared credentials (never commit) ──────────────────────────────────
*.cloudflared/
cloudflared.yml
!cloudflared.example.yml

# ── Python ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# ── Editor / OS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
nohup.out
